<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 27.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 27.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by KUKU Raadio on Tuesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>-Russia said that is it not happy with any kind of NATO expansion</p>
<p>- Finnish citizens will not be able to travel to Estonia without passports.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
